      <div><label for="ls-phone">Phone <span>(optional)</span></label><input id="ls-phone" type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel"></div>
      <div class="full"><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Get my free local visibility report</button></div>
      <p class="fine full">We use your details only to send your report and follow up about it. See our <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><h2 id="faq-h">Questions before you request yours</h2></div>
    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>Will this guarantee I rank number one on Google?</summary><div><p>No. Local search results change by location, device and the exact words someone searches, and nobody can honestly guarantee a specific ranking. What we can do is identify the gaps most likely holding your visibility back.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Do I need a Google Business Profile for this?</summary><div><p>It helps, but isn't required. If you don't have one yet, that's one of the first things we'll flag — it's usually the single biggest gap for a local business.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>What do I get?</summary><div><p>A written summary covering your Google Business Profile, website's local signals, review presence and the improvements we'd prioritize first.</p></div></details>
